{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0000002 mitochondrial genome maintenance \nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29646\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/17sfikFTQoFAKtV9jbH9k2JlPsH3EdKXj5NmX32UegNg/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n\nImpacted groups: \n\n  1 CAFA  @Antonialock \n   5 CGD @jlewsmith \n   6 FlyBase @hattrill \n   5 GeneDB @uliboehme \n   4 MGI @LiNiMGI \n   1 PINC @pgaudet \n  47 SGD @suzialeksander \n   5 TAIR @tberardini \n   9 UniProt @Antonialock \n   2 ZFIN @doughowe \n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\nInterPro:IPR009446 Mitochondrial genome maintenance protein Mgm101  -> mitochondrial DNA repair\nInterPro:IPR016610 Exonuclease V, Saccharomyces  ->\nInterPro:IPR024629 Large ribosomal subunit protein mL67  -> mitochondrial translation\nInterPro:IPR031415 Required for respiratory growth protein 8, mitochondrial  -> there might be  enough info to map this family to [mitochondrial tRNA 5'-end processing](https://www.yeastgenome.org/go/GO:0097745)  https://www.yeastgenome.org/reference/S000246545\nInterPro:IPR031455 Genetic interactor of prohibitin 5 \nInterPro:IPR039627 Mitochondrial escape protein 2  (unknown, RNA binding so likely gene expression but we have no info yet)\nHAMAP:MF_03030 \nHAMAP:MF_03102 \nHAMAP:MF_03103 \nHAMAP:MF_03104 \nHAMAP:MF_03105 \nHAMAP:MF_03176 \nHAMAP:MF_03177 \nUniRule:UR000106107 \nUniRule:UR000106116 \nUniRule:UR000106136 \nUniRule:UR000106401 \nUniRule:UR000112749 \nUniRule:UR000112754 \nUniRule:UR000369133 \nUniRule:UR000483751 \nUniRule:UR001426760 \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-04-29T14:22:14Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms", "mitochondrion"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0000002 mitochondrial genome maintenance", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-05T15:12:35Z"}
